{"title": "Assimilated Employee", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Assimilated Employee</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assimilated_Employee.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Assimilated Employee.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Assimilated_Employee.jpg/250px-Assimilated_Employee.jpg?2963b8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Assimilated_Employee.jpg/375px-Assimilated_Employee.jpg?2963b8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Assimilated_Employee.jpg/500px-Assimilated_Employee.jpg?2963b8 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nCadaver Bloom</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nAssimilatedEmployee<br />Enemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n8</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nMauling</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n28 (takes 1 damage from all sources)</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n30</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.25</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Assimilated Employee</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Cadaver_Bloom\">Cadaver Bloom</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is the corpse of an employee with several tendrils coming out of their body that it uses to move around. The head of the deceased employee is also on top of and speared by one of the tendrils.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the <b>Cadaver Bloom</b>, the <b>Assimilated Employee</b> will roam around until a player enters its line of sight. It will then quickly and erratically begin chasing and attempting to attack that player. It will deal 30 damage on contact and decapitate the player if they are killed by it.\n</p><p>Since the <b>Assimilated Employee</b> has a whopping 28hp and will only take 1 damage from any attack, the most effective ways to deal with are to prevent its spawning entirely or trap its AI. Beyond dying through unrecoverable means or behind a locked door, players can choose to die on terrain where enemy AI does not function properly to ensure the safety of the rest of the squad.\n</p><p>If players are in a situation where they must fight the <b>Assimilated Employee</b>, a shovel is most effective. It will be stunned when it gets hit and players can simply strafe backwards or in a circle and hit the <b>Assimilated Employee</b> every time it time it tries to rush close to them. In a desparate situation, a player can sacrifice themselves by using the <b>Mortar Hammer</b> to stun the <b>Assimilated Employee</b> for 30 seconds and open a window for another player to easily kill it.\n</p><p>If an <b>Assimilated Employee</b> is killed, the body of the assimilated player will drop. This uses the same model as the Cadaver Bloom and flowers will be sprouting from the corpse.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Assimilated Employee</b> can only spawn through the <a href=\"/wiki/Assimilated_Growth\" title=\"Assimilated Growth\"><b>Assimilated Growth</b></a> and its infection. As such, the <b>Assimilated Employee</b> can be encountered on <a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\"><b>Hyx</b></a>. It can additionally be encountered on <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Faith\" title=\"Faith\"><b>Faith</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\"><b>Filitrios</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fission-C\" title=\"Fission-C\"><b>Fission-C</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gloom\" title=\"Gloom\"><b>Gloom</b></a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Utril\" title=\"Utril\"><b>Utril</b></a> if players place a mysterious object on their exteriors to spawn the <b>Assimilated Growth</b> on future landings. This also applies to <a href=\"/wiki/Centrus\" title=\"Centrus\"><b>Centrus</b></a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vindict\" title=\"Vindict\"><b>Vindict</b></a> for placing the object on <b>Filitrios</b> or <b>Utril</b> respectively.<br /><br />The object is reset after being fired unless the <b>Brooding seeds</b> acquired from the hidden chamber on <a href=\"/wiki/Berunah\" title=\"Berunah\"><b>Berunah</b></a> are placed onto the exteriors of <a href=\"/wiki/Etern\" title=\"Etern\"><b>Etern</b></a>, <b>Filitrios</b>, <b>Fission-C</b>, <b>Gloom</b>, and <b>Utril</b>. The changes for every moon, including <b>Faith</b> regardless of if players moved the mysterious object in the <a href=\"/wiki/Faith#Secret_Passage\" title=\"Faith\"><b>Secret Passage</b></a>, become permanent on that save file if this condition is met. Oddly, <b>Etern</b> does not seem to spawn an <b>Assimilated Growth</b> despite also having an altar.</span></span>\n</p><p>While players can be fully infected and assimilated through <a href=\"/wiki/Hyx#Assimilation\" title=\"Hyx\"><b>Hyx's hazards</b></a>, the infection does not function properly if the <b>Assimilated Growth</b> has not spawned.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Assimilated employee <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">[Data not found]\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burst Music</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"8\" data-mwtitle=\"BurstMusic.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BurstMusic.mp3?68fef8\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/BurstMusic.mp3/BurstMusic.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bursting</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"7\" data-mwtitle=\"AEBurst.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/AEBurst.mp3?b53303\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/AEBurst.mp3/AEBurst.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tentacle Movements</td>\n<t